{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合148.45元，比本港收市低1.25元。工商銀行7.59元，與本港收市持平。建設銀行9.87元，高1仙。友邦保險73.52元，高0.22元。港交所371.47元，低3.13元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股414.01元，低3.79元。阿里巴巴107.04元，低1.76元。理想汽車44.5元，低0.26元。金沙中國11.51元，高2仙。長和65.61元，低0.29元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T22:59:26.181126+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:39.490967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T22:57:40.661736+00:00","content_hash":"adcec63bc6c563847dc45e1973e77c3c9b2dfabde831bcc14837e1fc56cfbf62","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}